ValidateFuncModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Validates an IR function: checks name/params/blocks as lists and runs each block through ValidateBlock. Returns 1 on success. Composite part of IsTargetNeutral.
    Provides: ValidateFunc(func) -> ok.
    DependsOn: ValidateBlock.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../ValidateFunc/ValidateFunc.sir).
